WEBVTT

00:00:00.772 --> 00:00:03.620
Meet Python three point thirteen point zero,

00:00:03.956 --> 00:00:06.660
with a new and improved interactive interpreter.

00:00:06.927 --> 00:00:11.780
It brings multi-line editing, color support, and colorized tracebacks.

00:00:12.100 --> 00:00:14.980
Try the experimental free-threaded build.

00:00:15.229 --> 00:00:18.500
Download it for Windows, macOS, or source,

00:00:18.860 --> 00:00:20.500
right from python dot org.
